# Jenova, Ancient Calamity: "Whenever a Mutant you control dies during your turn, you draw cards equal to its power." Turn 1 Bot1's Memnite becomes a Mutant (2/2). On turn 2, Bot2's turn, Bot2 casts a Savannah Lions and
# Lightning Bolts the Memnite: it dies on the wrong turn, Bot1 draws nothing. On turn 3 Jenova's trigger targets the opponent's Savannah Lions ("up to one other target creature", any controller): it gets a counter
# and is a Mutant (3/2), and when Bot1 kills it with its own Lightning Bolt on its own turn it draws nothing either, the Mutant not being under its control.

